  storyText: '{size=31}而且中州还有师兄坐镇，天魔道那帮混蛋至少得留下一个化神坐镇宗门。{/size}'
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 0
  AvatarID: {fileID: 0}
  AvatarIntID: 7
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
